    "created_at": "2021-07-10T09:01:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-07-10T09:05:20Z",
    "body": "The audience for the specification is software developers, not web developers. Web developer examples shouldn't even be in the specification. There should be documentation for web developers that is separate which covers how to use the standard.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
